---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="The iBridge Education privacy policy." locale="en" zhPath="/privacy/" enPath="/en/privacy/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Website policy" title="Privacy Policy" copy="This policy explains how the iBridge Education website handles contact information and general website data. Last updated: 29 July 2026." />
  <section class="section section-white"><article class="container legal">
    <h2>Information we receive</h2><p>This website does not create user accounts. When you contact us by email, we may receive your name, email address, school or organisation, and the requirements you choose to provide.</p>
    <h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information is used to respond to enquiries, discuss partnerships, provide service information, maintain website security and improve content. We do not sell personal information.</p>
    <h2>Contact form</h2><p>The contact form in this version opens your device’s default email application. The website itself does not store the form content. Sending and retention are governed by your email provider.</p>
    <h2>External services and links</h2><p>The website may later use analytics, file delivery or other external services. This policy will be updated before such services are introduced, with their purposes and data practices explained.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may request access to, correction of or deletion of personal information previously supplied by email, except where retention is legally required or reasonably necessary.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Privacy enquiries may be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@ibridge.info">hello@ibridge.info</a>.</p>
  </article></section>
</BaseLayout>
